Date: Tue, 25 Jul 2023 09:29:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] odhcpd: Add support for IPV6 NS DAD packet forwarding
 logic

Support to forward IPv6 NS-DAD packets received on the bridge
towards Modem to address a potential IPv6 address conflict.

Signed-off-by: aryamali <quic_aryamali@quicinc.com>
---
